1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:10,010
This video shows an animated background behind the text of a landing page. A grid of dots glows under drifting lights, and the text stays on top.

2
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:16,672
Our landing hero has a title, a line of text, and a button. Let's put the animation behind them.

3
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:34,772
It comes first in the hero, so the text is drawn over it. The file repeats forever, so the lights keep drifting.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,064
Let's look at the styles that place it.

5
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:49,166
The backdrop fills the whole hero, behind everything else. The file itself is set to cover its box, like a background image.

6
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:58,427
So, an animation can be a background like any image. One line puts it in, and a few styles keep it behind your content.
